OpenDMR languages — the interface languages, documentation translations and font files of OpenDMR

The translations (languages/*.json, docs/) are under the licence below, the same as OpenDMR's
(https://github.com/va3bpf/OpenDMR). The font files (languages/cjk.bin, made from Noto Sans SC) are under the SIL
Open Font License 1.1: languages/OFL-NotoSansSC.txt.

